{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "39265b37c2117763df8cd91a060144ec7934babe79e61ca7a7daf38eda4a049b", "ja": "兄ちゃん……今まで世話になったね。\nだが亜美は行くよ、終わりのない宇宙の旅へ！", "zh": "哥哥……一直以来谢谢你的照顾。\n不过，亚美要出发了，踏上无尽的宇宙之旅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1001_p", "source_sha256": "72bbf8f10c15a66520b75ebcb2e1f6ee0135dc0e9bea923c64e3e2be89e4a6c1", "ja": "亜美……とうとう行ってしまうのか。\nくれぐれも悪い宇宙人には気をつけるんだぞ。", "zh": "亚美……你终于要出发了吗。\n可千万要小心坏外星人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "b5bf2485eeb1f57f7d167edd7a94149ec410f2c52e5f6a2bef20098fd7768f2b", "ja": "ううっ、ぐすっ……\nだって旅立つことは、亜美の使命？だから！", "zh": "呜呜，吸鼻涕……\n因为启程踏上旅途，就是亚美的使命？呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1893de0adc4a2e632d3892d31a146356649c81523a1843fbe6f6ef4d7ce2a77d", "ja": "わかってる。だが忘れるな。1日3回は通信すること。\nご飯も3食食べること。それからちゃんと宿題を……", "zh": "我知道。不过别忘了，每1天要联系3次。饭也要吃3顿。还有，要好好把作业……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "6f4f5605d6a8f60d1660477d116af63f3a19f223e5a4299b5245d20528e80872", "ja": "うあうあ～っ！　約束ごとが多いよーっ！\nもう宇宙行くのやめるっ！　めんどくさいっ！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇～！要遵守的约定太多啦——！\n我不去宇宙了！好麻烦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "94711f6f6b72b289a8078125eee1c4177402bb483f5e9d3e99a5f59a8ddd682d", "ja": "なんだ、延期するのか……？　ま、いっか。\nそれにしてもその衣装、よく似合ってるな。", "zh": "什么，要延期吗……？嗯，也行吧。\n\n不过话说回来，这身衣服还真适合你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "f28f84806103423e8afde2a1122aa07ee72c2917841c3aeeefbe032f6903c31f", "ja": "あー、やっぱり？　兄ちゃんもそう思う？\n亜美もメッチャお気に入りだよー！", "zh": "啊——果然吧？哥哥也这么觉得？亚美也超喜欢这套衣服哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "bb68fda831cfa578cf302af16ace60fce7d21c0704ba5657034fd3db036c2e60", "ja": "この光るラインも、流れ星のキセキみたいだよね！", "zh": "这道发光的线，也像流星划过的奇迹一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "12b89dd20076b5716ed34056d438bfd0fe611cb59493c50d1987812d755b59ca", "ja": "ああ、本当に綺麗だ。黎明の空に合うような\nデザインで、曲のイメージにもピッタリだしな。", "zh": "啊，真的很漂亮。这个设计很适合黎明的天空，也和歌曲的形象非常契合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "e9e44900f9e4d812d8153d1aba8b4f63fca169ebeca60be8b3df32366161c0d4", "ja": "うん！　そだ、亜美ね、衣装合わせの前に、\nお姫ちんからレーメイの意味、教えてもらったんだ！", "zh": "嗯！对了，亚美我啊，在试衣服之前，公主告诉了我“黎明”的意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "c591195da3354c366c252f1611c82d41e324419df3ca03a2de685ab3a52c0853", "ja": "レーメイはねー、たしか……\n夜明け、っていう意味なんだよね？", "zh": "“黎明”啊——我记得是……\n指天亮的意思，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "45e0dc2d9b5ac1f7b1b6136652b34737620eef516001ca893bd26ce9f9f0e54f", "ja": "そうだな。ひいては……\n黎明は、新時代の幕開けを指す言葉でもあるな。", "zh": "没错。进一步说……\n“黎明”也是指新时代开端的词语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "960a41e758a00496f8019ad3e3861bfd7caad28d7bb535525121dd3b577d78d1", "ja": "亜美たちなら、きっと新しい時代を切り開いて\nキラキラ輝くトップアイドルになれると信じてるよ。", "zh": "我相信，要是亚美她们的话，一定能开创全新的时代，成为闪闪发光的顶级偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "d94a62d5cf7bdcd9fea4bc4c38c543114c631a3365a655da5b1523a186308b41", "ja": "新しい時代……キラキラ……。亜美、燃えてきたよ！\n衣装も、もっとキラキラギラギラになれば完璧じゃん？", "zh": "新的时代……闪闪发光……亚美燃起来了！\n要是服装也能变得更加闪闪发亮、金光四射，不就很完美了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "7373c6f8a8312c75241f881f6f65dd10b81b9778df9d9f6f09da648a0bc8a227", "ja": "さっそくロコロコとみさきちに頼んで、ド派手な\nギラギラ電飾を増やしてもらおーっと！　お～～い！", "zh": "这就去拜托ROCOROCO和美咲，让她们帮忙多加些超级浮夸、闪闪发亮的电饰吧！喂～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa6911d478295c6d7b7036fbd8733979330eb50d4c1c36f84a67c0591aa8f19a", "ja": "ま、待てっ！　意気込みはいいと思うが、\n……電飾を追加で増やして、本当に大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "等、等一下！干劲固然值得肯定，\n但……再追加彩灯真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cd44d695f878be0656384428dd35e48106283cc18cccb27fc351d0f2eb4396c7", "ja": "衣装の電飾はな、たくさんつけると……その、\n熱いし、重いんだ。適量ってのがあるんじゃないか。", "zh": "服装上的电饰啊，装得太多的话……那个，会很热，也很重的。应该还是要适量吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "f48be476a31288ff6fd12aa27c66e1e2be64ecbe418ffc1c38e8cfe8fbfa56bf", "ja": "そ、そうかっ……亜美はなんてうっかりなんだ。\n兄ちゃんの言う通りだよ。重すぎなのはヤダもんね！", "zh": "原、原来如此……亚美真是太粗心了。哥哥说得对。太重了可不行嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "76adf8746e064253a911704f738cc31d4467471595c3a9c128f8df0893aa95dc", "ja": "亜美は、このちょうどいい感じにキラキラの衣装を\n生かして軽やかに！　ステージで輝いてみせるかんね！", "zh": "我会好好利用这套闪闪发亮、恰到好处的服装，展现轻盈的感觉！在舞台上闪耀给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0204_1019_p", "source_sha256": "080fbe468ba26d7dc384ff91b1e53be5df49b7c7225ab591030716489d618f39", "ja": "（ふぅ……。そうだ、夜明けの空に光る星のように\n新時代の輝きを見せてくれよ、亜美！）", "zh": "（呼……。对了，就像黎明天空中闪耀的星星一样，展现出新时代的光辉吧，亚美！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
